Aerie-Purpose: Make the search engines test support build TemplateURLService with Helium's constructor.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: components/search_engines/{search_engines_test_environment,template_url_service_test_util}.cc, chrome/browser/search_engines/template_url_service_test_util.cc (test-only code)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Helium adds a url_loader_factory argument to the TemplateURLService constructor.
The test support passes none, so the service never loads remote data.
Test-only: nothing in the shipped browser links it. Issue #175.

